hints.pseudocode:
counts = empty map; total = 0; best = 0
for i in 0 .. n - 1:
  add numbers[i]: counts[numbers[i]] += 1; total += numbers[i]
  if i >= k: remove numbers[i - k]: counts -= 1 (delete the entry at 0); total -= numbers[i - k]
  if i >= k - 1 and the number of entries in counts == k: best = max(best, total)
return best
